OL,3,AAnti-terror police investigate as one
OL,4,Aperson killed in shooting near Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed and at least
OL,7,Ffour others wounded in a gun attack in
OL,8,Fa Parisian suburb, which police have
OL,9,Fsaid they are treating as a terrorist
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FFrench Prime Minister Sebastien Lecornu
OL,13,Fsaid the "very serious events" happened
OL,14,Fin Trappes, to the southwest of Paris,
OL,15,Fadding that the suspected attacker had
OL,16,Fbeen "apprehended and placed in police
OL,17,Fcustody".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
